# Artificial Evolution's two creature types: the one replaced may be any, Wall included, but the new one "can't be Wall" and,
# as the ruling has it, must be a different word from the first (CR 612.1). Each limit is a refusal beside the choice that
# is legal. Concealing Curtains is a Wall: Wall is offered as the type to replace and not as the new type, and it becomes a
# Goblin. Goblin Welder's Goblin may not become a Goblin, so it becomes an Elf; its name still says Goblin (CR 612.2). Bot2's
# Swamp has no creature types or words at all, and may still be targeted (a permanent with nothing to change); it is
# unchanged.

